flowchart TD
  START[Training / acquisition] --> SAVE[atomic checkpoint:\ntemp file then rename]
  SAVE --> OK{interrupted?}
  OK -->|no| DONE[complete artifact]
  OK -->|yes, during write| TMP[temp file discarded\nlast good checkpoint intact]
  TMP --> RESUME[resume from last checkpoint]
  RESUME --> START
  NET[network fetch] --> FAIL{http != 200\nor TLS error}
  FAIL -->|error| HARD[raise, no empty data]
  FAIL -->|ok| CACHE[cache + provenance]
